# Copy to .env.local (gitignored) and restart `npm run dev` after editing —
# Vite inlines import.meta.env.* at build time.
#
# WalletConnect Cloud project id, free at https://cloud.walletconnect.com.
# Powers the "Connect Paytaca" button on #/employee, which asks the wallet for
# an address and derives the 20-byte payee PKH from it.
#
# OPTIONAL. Leave it unset and every screen still works end to end — payroll
# needs no wallet, because paySalary carries no signature. Unset simply makes
# the connect button explain that it is unconfigured (and drops the
# WalletConnect SDK from the bundle entirely).
VITE_WC_PROJECT_ID=
